**OWASP:** A05 – Security Misconfiguration

Express sends no security headers by default. The app is missing `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Frame-Options`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `Strict-Transport-Security`, and `Referrer-Policy`, all of which protect against XSS, clickjacking, and MIME sniffing.

**Fix:** Add `helmet`:

