### 🚨 Finding 3 — No Security Headers (OWASP A05: Security Misconfiguration)

**Severity: HIGH**

Express by default sends an `X-Powered-By: Express` header (fingerprinting) and sets none of the standard security headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, etc.). This exposes the app to clickjacking, MIME-sniffing, and other browser-based attacks.

```js
