### 🚨 Finding 4 — No Rate Limiting (OWASP A04: Insecure Design / DoS Risk)

**Severity: HIGH**

Any endpoint — especially `/users` — can be hammered with unlimited requests. This enables brute-force attacks, credential stuffing, and denial-of-service.

