## Finding 2 — 🔴 Sensitive Data Exposure (PII)
**OWASP A02: Cryptographic Failures / A01: Broken Access Control**

The `/users` endpoint returns `email` fields to all callers. Email addresses are PII under GDPR/CCPA.

**Fix — apply field-level filtering and scope data to the requesting user:**
```js
app.get('/users', requireAuth, (req, res) => {
  // Non-admin users can only see their own record
  if (req.user.role !== 'admin') {
    const self = users.find(u => u.id === req.user.id);
    // Strip sensitive fields for non-admin callers
    return res.json(self ? [{ id: self.id, name: self.name }] : []);
